Z||000029||rogergarrison||10-06-2000||06:10 AM||||lighting laws are stupid as most laws seem to be. Owning a body shop ive seen lots of 'legal' OEM headlites made of that great plastic , the 'chrome' in them is gone or turned black and there not much briter than parking lites. Lincoln, and Ford Escort are 2 that come to mind. I have a Ferrari kit on my 86 SE chassis but im modifying the headlites using late model slim factory sealed bulbs from a full size chevy van (prob same as Camaro). Ill be making clear lexan covers so I wont have the usual retractable problems anymore. Look will be similar to the 300Z but wont cost $700.00 like the Nissan (my cost!). I think the F-40 kits actually use the Nissan units.||||reg||1
